      "content": "thanks. i'm also seeing some weirdly uneven distribution of these markings in certain clusters of shards. some areas are heavily treated and others are almost bare, even though they're from the same context. does that suggest a specific firing technique or could it just be due to how the pieces were scattered or broken up?",
